# Keep the working tree LF on every platform.
#
# The build and validate scripts parse fenced code blocks and section
# headings out of markdown. With core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout
# rewrites every file to CRLF, the fence patterns stop matching, and
# `npm run build` fails with a confusing "no yaml block in ## Setup".
# Pinning eol here means a clone behaves the same everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
